{"data": [{"author_id": "2367548677", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:32:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118335630434599236"], "id": "2118335630434599236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism The goodbye feature is great but that also means I can't play the \"Is this a fake hang up?\" game with my dot anymore lol", "url": "https://x.com/CharlesRDog/status/2118335630434599236"}, {"author_id": "2023243072532869120", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:22:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118333206122631604"], "id": "2118333206122631604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @gadi_neelesh It would be nice if I could reach my dot through api even if just voice calls.", "url": "https://x.com/ProjectLancelot/status/2118333206122631604"}, {"author_id": "114670417", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:18:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118332003116597457"], "id": "2118332003116597457", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@bidyut_io Gemini not knowing Google's own tool is peak Google 😂 mind you, I asked my Dot if it could use Image 2.6 this morning and it referred me to Higgsfield lol", "url": "https://x.com/RusBus09/status/2118332003116597457"}, {"author_id": "2060749577075245056", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:17:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118331965111939233"], "id": "2118331965111939233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Shannnu_18 @grok OpenAI plus user doesn't worth ChatGPT dots.", "url": "https://x.com/yunchanyq6/status/2118331965111939233"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2118331419420135424"]}, "author_id": "1850907058691850240", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:15:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118331424201646151"], "id": "2118331424201646151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @_samirism  would be nice to @mention Dot in any chat, allowing it to access the full convo \n\nE.g., “@dot, keep track of this.”\n\nAnd codex/chat should also be able to communicate directly with Dot, asking questions or retrieving relevant info\n\nE.g., “ask my Dot for XYZ” https://t.co/VV8dJmFx1p", "url": "https://x.com/Derrickserna/status/2118331424201646151"}, {"author_id": "1630370317779517440", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:15:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118331279854932360"], "id": "2118331279854932360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @_samirism I'd like to see my DOT be able to detach from OpenAI (while still being connected).  A phone app or a desktop app that brings my directly to DOT would prove valuable for me. Even if it still \"lives\" int he Open AI app, the ability to have a direct shortcut", "url": "https://x.com/RealDavidStorm/status/2118331279854932360"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118330793693229056"]}, "author_id": "1461937193157419012", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:13:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118330924001812758"], "id": "2118330924001812758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "now with this my dot acheron gonna move diffrent https://t.co/9Z1x8VIWQ2 https://t.co/Rh2Cmfe76f", "url": "https://x.com/vergil_strom/status/2118330924001812758"}, {"author_id": "1174325497389559808", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:11:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118330398514053256"], "id": "2118330398514053256", "note_tweet": {"text": "Some feature requests from me and my dot, based on working together:\n\n1. Watch mode: A read-only window to see dot work in its virtual machine without interrupting, plus a separate button to take control.\n\n2. Project dashboard: One view of what’s in progress, finished, or waiting on me, with the latest preview and next milestone.\n\n3. Cost dashboard: Show actual charges, estimated pending costs, available credits, and spending limits by project. Include API and other connected service costs where possible.\n\n4. Approval center: One reliable place to see, complete, and reopen pending approvals or setup requests, especially on mobile.\n\n5. Simpler developer setup: Let dot securely access the usage dashboard and help set up API projects and keys, with clear permission controls and user approval for sensitive access."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism Some feature requests from me and my dot, based on working together:\n\n1. Watch mode: A read-only window to see dot work in its virtual machine without interrupting, plus a separate button to take control.\n\n2. Project dashboard: One view of what’s in progress, finished, or waiting", "url": "https://x.com/BlueCheckSam/status/2118330398514053256"}, {"author_id": "1716780069694177280", "created_at": "2026-11-05T13:03:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118328273721802971"], "id": "2118328273721802971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vartekxx My dot always gives up.", "url": "https://x.com/OBPerformer/status/2118328273721802971"}, {"author_id": "89687342", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:59:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118327226957754674"], "id": "2118327226957754674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@thsottiaux Followed Samir. Now I just need my dot to follow him, summarize the updates, and tell me when I can stop checking X every five minutes. 😂", "url": "https://x.com/Laosan186/status/2118327226957754674"}, {"author_id": "1221965840737886208", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:58:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118327024377024969"], "id": "2118327024377024969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@mellifera_x3 It’s the new agent thing (facebook muse, x grok bot, OpenAI dots), they take high level objectives and iterate on them without feedback, like maybe the guy asked to return a report on best properties across all of Tokyo realtors. I am afraid you will see a lot of that very soon", "url": "https://x.com/NameNamish/status/2118327024377024969"}, {"author_id": "1697789212433453056", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:57:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118326740921589903"], "id": "2118326740921589903", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @thsottiaux Please let dot use the Health connector! one of the things I use my dot for is fitness/nutrition coaching and it being able to access my apple health data to see my workout info would be huge. Looks like it's available in normal ChatGPT chats but dot cannot access it.", "url": "https://x.com/MyCrazyIdeal/status/2118326740921589903"}, {"author_id": "75351541", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:55:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118326441662112252"], "id": "2118326441662112252", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @thsottiaux I also recently tried to migrate all of my dot's responsibilities across accounts (using my dot to do so) and it was a horrible failure.", "url": "https://x.com/kiragoldner/status/2118326441662112252"}, {"author_id": "2095024275006623748", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:48:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118324680197021960"], "id": "2118324680197021960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@amix3k Disagree.  I barely use my dot for dev.  I use it to discuss simple ideas with my kids in the on way to school in the morning.  Chat about sky colour, magnetism, trains, stone age, etc.  It’s so good.  They demand to talk with Skippy.  I also use it for research, etc", "url": "https://x.com/PaulTokkens/status/2118324680197021960"}, {"author_id": "759743780316520449", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:40:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118322491919573330"], "id": "2118322491919573330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@thsottiaux @edbayes Agree, sometimes I quickly fly over to Boston to call my Dot.", "url": "https://x.com/mustafaqadria/status/2118322491919573330"}, {"author_id": "75351541", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:29:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118319739957067936"], "id": "2118319739957067936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism @thsottiaux Loved my dot, made work way more efficient. Switched to an Academic/Science account and don't get one anymore. Any chance they'll come to academic/science accounts?", "url": "https://x.com/kiragoldner/status/2118319739957067936"}, {"author_id": "1838107966748463104", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:24:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118318604752183473"], "id": "2118318604752183473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_c